st-cat
--------------------
st-cat is a fork of the st terminal for X.

Included patches
--------------------
st-blinking_cursor-20230819-3a6d6d7.diff
st-bold-is-not-bright-20190127-3be4cf1.diff
st-newterm-0.9.diff
st-scrollback-ringbuffer-0.9.2.diff
st-font2-0.8.5.diff

--------------------
Install with:

    make clean install
